<title>JAPAN: Sanyo Electric shares rise in heavy trade.</title>
<headline>Sanyo Electric shares rise in heavy trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanyo Electric Co Ltd shares firmed in heavy trade on Monday morning, as they attracted buying as a laggard among electronic companies, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price gained three yen to trade at 528 yen at 0110 GMT. Turnover of about one million shares was the sixth heaviest volume on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
